{"content": "<div style=\"margin: 5px 0; padding: 8px; background: linear-gradient(135deg, #ff6600 0%, #ff8533 100%); border-radius: 4px;\">\n    <h2 style=\"margin: 0; color: #ffffff; font-size: 18px; text-align: center;\">\u5317\u7f8eAI\u79d1\u6280\u65e5\u62a5</h2>\n    <p style=\"margin: 5px 0 0 0; color: #fffbe6; font-size: 14px; text-align: center;\">\u7167\u4f8b\u6765\u770b\u770b\u4eca\u5929AI\u5708\u6709\u4ec0\u4e48\u65b0\u9c9c\u4e8b\u3002</p>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"margin: 15px 0; padding: 15px; background: #fff3e0; border-left: 4px solid #e65100; border-radius: 4px;\">\n    <h3 style=\"margin: 0 0 10px 0; color: #e65100; font-size: 16px;\">\u70ed\u70b9\u805a\u7126</h3>\n    <p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6;\">\n        <a href=\"https://www.latent.space/p/ainews-the-biggest-claude-launch\" style=\"color: #e65100; text-decoration: none; font-weight: bold;\">The Biggest Claude Launch of All Time</a>\n    </p>\n    <p style=\"margin: 8px 0 0 0; color: #666; font-size: 13px;\">Claude\u53f2\u4e0a\u6700\u5927\u53d1\u5e03\u6765\u4e86\uff01The Biggest Claude Launch of All Time</p>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"margin: 15px 0; padding: 12px; background: #f5f5f5; border-left: 3px solid #e65100; border-radius: 0 4px 4px 0;\">\n    <h3 style=\"margin: 0; color: #e65100; font-size: 15px; font-weight: bold;\">HackerNews</h3>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"margin: 10px 0; padding: 10px 0; border-top: 1px dashed #e0e0e0;\">\n    <span style=\"display: inline-block; padding: 2px 8px; background: #e65100; color: white; border-radius: 3px; font-size: 12px; font-weight: bold; margin-right: 8px;\">01</span>\n    <a href=\"https://bethmathews.substack.com/p/why-so-many-control-rooms-were-seafoam\" style=\"color: #333; text-decoration: none; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.4;\">Why so many control rooms were seafoam green (2025)</a>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"margin: 10px 0; padding: 10px 0; border-top: 1px dashed #e0e0e0;\">\n    <span style=\"display: inline-block; padd